2 0 obj
<<
/Producer (PyPDF2)
/Title (\055functions\040of\040\055sheaves\040and\040Drinfeld\040modules)
/Author (Y\056\040Taguchi\054\040Daqing\040Wan)
/Subject (In\040this\040paper\054\040we\040apply\040Dwork\047s\040p\055adic\040methods\040to\040study\040the\040meromorphic\040continuation\040and\040rationality\040of\040various\040L\055functions\040arising\040from\0407r\055adic\040Galois\040representations\054\040Drinfeld\040modules\040and\040\050p\055sheaves\056\040As\040a\040consequence\054\040we\040prove\040some\040conjectures\040of\040Goss\040about\040the\040rationality\040of\040the\040local\040L\055function\040and\040the\040meromorphic\040continuation\040of\040the\040global\040L\055function\040attached\040to\040a\040Drinfeld\040module\056\040Let\040Fq\040be\040a\040finite\040field\040of\040q\040elements\040with\040characteristic\040p\056\040Let\0407r\040be\040a\040prime\040of\040the\040polynomial\040ring\040A\040\075\040Fq\040\133t\135\056\040Let\040A\054\040be\040the\040completion\040of\040the\040ring\040A\040at\0407r\056\040This\040is\040an\040analogue\040of\040the\040classical\040ring\0407p\040of\040p\055adic\040integers\056\040Let\040X\040be\040an\040irreducible\040algebraic\040variety\040defined\040over\040Fq\040and\040let\0407r\054\040\050X\051\040be\040the\040arithmetic\040fundamental\040group\040of\040X\057IFq\040with\040respect\040to\040some\040base\040point\056\040The\040group\0407r\054\040\050X\051\040may\040be\040regarded\040as\040the\040Galois\040groiip\040of\040a\040separable\040closure\040of\040the\040function\040field\040of\040X\057Fq\040modulo\040the\040inertia\040groups\040at\040the\040closed\040points\040of\040X\057lq\056\040Suppose\040now\040that\040we\040are\040given\040a\040continuous\0407r\055adic\040representation)
/Keywords (01\040Jan\0401996\054\040Journal\040of\040the\040American\040Mathematical\040Society\054\040Drinfeld\040module\054\040Galois\040module\054\040Galois\040cohomology\054\040Separable\040polynomial\054\040Ring\040\050mathematics\051\054\040Tokyo\040Metropolitan\040University\054\040University\040of\040Nevada\054\040Las\040Vegas)
>>
endobj
